---
// CLI Installation — Italian translation.
// Commands and code blocks stay English. Headings and descriptions translated.
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooterIt from '../../../../components/SiteFooterIt.astro';
import InstallFromSourceIt from '../../../../components/InstallFromSourceIt.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="it"
  title="Installa la CLI di SpecScore"
  description="Installa la CLI specscore su macOS, Linux o Windows tramite curl, Homebrew, PowerShell, WinGet, Scoop o compilando dal codice sorgente."
  canonical="https://specscore.md/it/cli/install/"
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero__inner">
        <p class="hero__eyebrow">
          <a href="/it/cli/" class="xref">SpecScore CLI</a>
        </p>
        <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero__headline">Installazione</h1>
        <p class="hero__sub">
          Scegli il metodo più adatto al tuo ambiente. Tutti installano lo stesso
          binario <code>specscore</code> dalla stessa
          <a class="xref" href="https://github.com/specscore/specscore-cli/releases">release di GitHub</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="quick-install" aria-labelledby="quick-title">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--prose">
        <h2 id="quick-title" class="section-title">Installazione rapida (macOS e Linux)</h2>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">$</span> curl -fsSL https://specscore.md/install/get-cli | sh</pre>
        <p class="method-desc">
          Lo script rileva il tuo sistema operativo e l'architettura, scarica l'archivio
          corrispondente dall'ultima release di GitHub, verifica il relativo checksum
          SHA-256 e installa il binario <code>specscore</code> in <code>/usr/local/bin</code>
          (o <code>~/.local/bin</code> se <code>/usr/local/bin</code> non è scrivibile).
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">Opzioni</h3>
        <table class="options-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Variabile</th><th>Predefinito</th><th>Descrizione</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><code>SPECSCORE_VERSION</code></td>
              <td><code>latest</code></td>
              <td>Tag della release da installare, es. <code>v0.1.0</code>.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>SPECSCORE_INSTALL_DIR</code></td>
              <td><code>/usr/local/bin</code> o <code>~/.local/bin</code></td>
              <td>Directory in cui installare il binario.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p class="method-desc">Installa una versione specifica in <code>~/.local/bin</code>:</p>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">$</span> curl -fsSL https://specscore.md/install/get-cli | \
  SPECSCORE_VERSION=v0.1.0 SPECSCORE_INSTALL_DIR="$HOME/.local/bin" sh</pre>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">Esamina prima di eseguire</h3>
        <p class="method-desc">Se preferisci esaminare lo script prima di eseguirlo:</p>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">$</span> curl -fsSL https://specscore.md/install/get-cli -o get-cli.sh
<span class="prompt">$</span> less get-cli.sh
<span class="prompt">$</span> sh get-cli.sh</pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="homebrew" aria-labelledby="brew-title">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--prose">
        <h2 id="brew-title" class="section-title">Homebrew (macOS e Linux)</h2>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">$</span> brew install specscore/tap/specscore</pre>
        <p class="method-desc">
          Aggiunge il tap <code>specscore/homebrew-tap</code> alla prima
          installazione e segue le nuove release da lì.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="windows" aria-labelledby="win-title">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--prose">
        <h2 id="win-title" class="section-title">Windows</h2>
        <p class="method-desc">
          Scegli uno qualsiasi dei tre metodi — tutti installano lo stesso
          binario dalla stessa release di GitHub.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">PowerShell</h3>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">PS&gt;</span> powershell -c "irm https://specscore.md/install/get-cli.ps1 | iex"</pre>
        <p class="method-desc">
          Lo script rileva la tua architettura, scarica il file <code>.zip</code>
          corrispondente dall'ultima release, verifica il suo checksum SHA-256,
          installa <code>specscore.exe</code> in
          <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\specscore\bin</code> e aggiunge quella
          directory al tuo <code>PATH</code> utente. Non sono richiesti privilegi
          di amministratore. Riavvia il terminale dopo l'esecuzione affinché il
          <code>PATH</code> aggiornato abbia effetto.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">WinGet</h3>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">PS&gt;</span> winget install Synchestra.SpecScore</pre>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">Scoop</h3>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">PS&gt;</span> scoop bucket add specscore https://github.com/specscore/scoop-bucket
<span class="prompt">PS&gt;</span> scoop install specscore</pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="manual" aria-labelledby="manual-title">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--prose">
        <h2 id="manual-title" class="section-title">Installazione manuale</h2>
        <ol class="manual-steps">
          <li>
            Scarica l'archivio per la tua piattaforma dalla
            <a class="xref" href="https://github.com/specscore/specscore-cli/releases">pagina delle release di GitHub</a>.
            Gli archivi seguono il pattern <code>specscore_&lt;version&gt;_&lt;os&gt;_&lt;arch&gt;.&lt;ext&gt;</code>.
          </li>
          <li>
            Verifica il checksum SHA-256 confrontandolo con
            <code>specscore_&lt;version&gt;_checksums.txt</code> della stessa release.
          </li>
          <li>
            Estrai l'archivio e sposta <code>specscore</code>
            (o <code>specscore.exe</code> su Windows) in una directory presente nel tuo <code>PATH</code>.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="source" aria-labelledby="source-title">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--prose">
        <h2 id="source-title" class="section-title">Compila dal codice sorgente</h2>
        <InstallFromSourceIt />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="verify" aria-labelledby="verify-title">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--prose">
        <h2 id="verify-title" class="section-title">Verifica l'installazione</h2>
<pre class="terminal"><span class="prompt">$</span> specscore version
<span class="dim">specscore 0.1.0 (&lt;commit&gt;) &lt;date&gt;</span></pre>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooterIt />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-3) var(--space-4); background: var(--cream); }
  .hero__inner { max-width: var(--max-prose); margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero__eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: var(--fs-small); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--mid-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .hero__headline { font-size: var(--fs-h2); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .hero__sub { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--mid-ink); line-height: 1.55; }
  .hero__sub code { font-size: 0.9em; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 2px; }
  .section-title { font-size: var(--fs-h2); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .subsection-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--fs-h3); font-weight: 600; margin-top: var(--space-4); margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .method-desc { color: var(--mid-ink); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: var(--space-2); margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .method-desc code { font-size: 0.9em; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 2px; }
  .options-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: var(--space-3) 0; font-size: var(--fs-small); }
  .options-table th { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--mid-ink); text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .options-table td { padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--mid-ink); line-height: 1.5; }
  .options-table code { font-size: 0.9em; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 0.1em 0.3em; border-radius: 2px; }
  .manual-steps { color: var(--mid-ink); line-height: 1.65; padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0; }
  .manual-steps li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .manual-steps code { font-size: 0.9em; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 2px; }
  .section .terminal { margin-bottom: var(--space-1); }
</style>
